 for a drink or baked good, then decide whether to keep exploring or return to your room. Check dining’s current café hours before going.","short_summary":"A named café inside the library atrium.","evidence_claim":"Mount Holyoke identifies Frances Perk café in the Williston Library atrium and lists semester service hours, including weekend hours.","source_url":"https://lits.mtholyoke.edu/places/frances-perk-cafe","source_title":"Frances Perk café","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in the Williston Library atrium; dining directs visitors to its current menu and hours. Food and beverages require purchase.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"prospect-hill-trails","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Prospect Hill Trails","title":"Choose a short hill walk","subtitle":"Prospect Hill","notes":"Use the trail map to pick the Carriage Way Loop or 1882 Footpath. Stay on marked paths and take the route at a pace that works for your group.","short_summary":"A roughly one-mile network with mapped route options.","evidence_claim":"Mount Holyoke lists Prospect Hill Trails as a 1.6 km trail area and describes the Carriage Way Loop and 1882 Footpath as routes on Prospect Hill.","source_url":"https://www.mtholyoke.edu/academics/centers-and-facilities/campus-trails","source_title":"Campus Trails","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Consult the College’s downloadable trail map and use marked routes; conditions and accessibility can vary.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"stony-brook-long-farm-loop","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Stony Brook/Long Farm Loop","title":"Save a longer trail for Sunday","subtitle":"Campus trail system","notes":"If your 