 September reopening, visit the reinstalled collection galleries and choose one work to discuss. Check the museum’s visitor page immediately before making the trip.","short_summary":"A campus museum scheduled to reopen with renovated galleries.","evidence_claim":"The museum announces that its new collection galleries open September 8, 2026, and its visitor guidelines state that the museum is free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://artmuseum.mtholyoke.edu/exhibition/mhcam-at-150-our-new-collection-galleries/","source_title":"MHCAM at 150: Our New Collection Galleries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The museum’s visitor page says it is closed until Fall 2026; this card applies after the announced September 8 reopening. Verify current access before visiting.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
